    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36a0f0da869220fa",
      "translationZh": "可使用 T4 GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0b939fb659f8053",
      "translationZh": "低代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "644d5ed7862bb5b0",
      "translationZh": "适合小规模负载和量化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c236daafb445f86",
      "translationZh": "部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80adedc85a40bed2",
      "translationZh": "在我们的示例中，我们将使用 Predibase 的 LoRA Land 中展示的几个优秀适配器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7eb2fad2b8ca18d",
      "translationZh": "predibase/customer_support 在 Gridspace-Stanford Harper Valley 语音数据集上进行了训练，这增强了它准确理解和回应客户服务交互的能力。这提高了模型在语音识别、情绪检测和对话管理等任务中的表现，从而提供更高效、更具同理心的客户支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db6d4670cd315b9a",
      "translationZh": "predibase/magicoder 在 ise-uiuc/Magicoder-OSS-Instruct-75K 上进行了训练，这是一个合成生成的代码指令数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce0c51ebc7edbd24",
      "translationZh": "关于如何部署 TGI，已经有很多优质资料。按照你平常的方式部署即可，但请确保：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a26e844c686f1099",
      "translationZh": "使用 v2.1.1 或更新版本的 TGI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbdcb17c4f07d217",
      "translationZh": "部署你的基础模型：mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f459bc56a43b1a3f",
      "translationZh": "在部署时添加 LORA_ADAPTERS 环境变量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ef01f3e977dd2ee",
      "translationZh": "示例：LORA_ADAPTERS=predibase/customer_support,predibase/magicoder",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "260a08f22e1098e9",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 图形用户界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eb395cdb917d496",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 让你只需点击几下，就能在 AWS、GCP 和 Azure 上的多种 GPU 及其他硬件类型上部署任意 Hugging Face 模型！通过图形用户界面，部署非常简单。在底层，我们默认使用 TGI 进行文本生成（不过，你也可以选择使用任意镜像）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "844b419e06770cd4",
      "translationZh": "要在 Inference Endpoints 上使用 Multi-LoRA 服务，你只需进入你的控制面板，然后：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "383d386dbc0b4130",
      "translationZh": "选择你的基础模型：mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6854554e17764760",
      "translationZh": "选择你的云平台 | 区域 | 硬件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4fde22428e722a4",
      "translationZh": "我将使用 AWS | us-east-1 | Nvidia L4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8176f09ca981ff19",
      "translationZh": "选择高级配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9b03c1ff5521508",
      "translationZh": "你应该会看到文本生成已被选中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82772901497b4d52",
      "translationZh": "你可以根据自己的需求进行配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad2bf679e6ecc9f5",
      "translationZh": "在环境变量中添加 LORA_ADAPTERS=predibase/customer_support,predibase/magicoder",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f212e9c819fe183",
      "translationZh": "最后，创建端点！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4f51732e4050117",
      "translationZh": "请注意，这只是最低要求，你应该根据自己的需要配置其他设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9435fcdd943f700",
      "translationZh": "图 3：Multi-LoRA 推理端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f56083e1892a8d1",
      "translationZh": "图 4：Multi-LoRA 推理端点 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9af7644e7ade3b0d",
      "translationZh": "推理端点代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb7673a8f65dbdad",
      "translationZh": "也许你们中的一些人有“鼠标恐惧症”，不想使用鼠标，我们不会评判。用代码自动完成这些操作、全程只用键盘也很容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eebe61f294ba26a7",
      "translationZh": "部署这一配置花了约 3 分 40 秒。请注意，模型越多，耗时就越长。如果你遇到加载时间方面的问题，请务必提交一个 github issue！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b615cfb6c3e6ff4",
      "translationZh": "调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40dcf608703c1c24",
      "translationZh": "调用端点时，你需要指定 adapter_id。下面是一个 cURL 示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d46305b90a2c8b7d",
      "translationZh": "另外，这里有一个使用出色的 Hugging Face Hub Python 库中的 InferenceClient 的示例。请务必确保使用 huggingface-hub>=0.24.0，并在必要时登录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6ddd6a2cd3c0cfe6",
      "translationZh": "实际考量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "204a5eb2cd28bcfd",
      "translationZh": "成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa117c55b2f2aa77",
      "translationZh": "我们并不是第一批登上这座山峰的人，下文会对此展开讨论。LoRAX 背后的团队 Predibase 撰写了一篇出色的文章。请务必读一读，因为本节以他们的工作为基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07e498c8bd7517d6",
      "translationZh": "图 5：Multi-LoRA 成本。对于 TGI，我在 nvidia-l4 上部署了 mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 作为基础模型，使用 Inference Endpoints 的成本为 $0.8/hr。在平均输入为 450 个 token、输出为 234 个 token 的情况下，我实现了每秒 75 次请求，并针对 GPT3.5 Turbo 做了相应调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1d4c85324f71125",
      "translationZh": "Multi-LoRA 服务的一大优势是，你不需要为多个模型分别进行多次部署，最终成本会低得多。这应该符合你的直觉，因为多个模型需要各自完整的权重，而不只是小小的适配器层。如图 5 所示，即使我们通过 TGI Multi-LoRA 添加更多模型，每个 token 的成本也保持不变。TGI 专用部署的成本则会随着模型数量增加而增长，因为每个微调模型都需要一次新的部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "797b1dac2b3463ae",
      "translationZh": "使用模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6b90386bebcfd23",
      "translationZh": "图 6：Multi-LoRA 服务模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19cb69c82386ae73",
      "translationZh": "部署多个模型时，一个现实挑战是各个模型的使用模式会有很大差异。有些模型的使用量可能很低，有些可能呈突发式使用，还有些可能被高频使用。这使得扩缩容非常困难，尤其是在每个模型都独立运行的情况下。当你不得不再增加一块 GPU 时，就会产生很多“取整”误差，而这些误差会迅速累积。理想情况下，你会最大限度地提高每块 GPU 的利用率，而不使用任何多余的 GPU。你需要确保有足够的 GPU 可用，同时也知道其中一些会处于空闲状态，这可能相当繁琐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da93af1504217c16",
      "translationZh": "当我们使用 Multi-LoRA 进行整合时，使用情况就会稳定得多。我们可以在图 6 中看到这一效果：Multi-Lora Serving 的使用模式相当稳定，尽管它是由波动更大的模式组成的。通过整合模型，你可以让使用情况更加平稳，扩缩容也更易于管理。请注意，这些只是示意性的模式，但你可以仔细想想自己的使用模式，以及 Multi-LoRA 能如何提供帮助。对 1 个模型进行扩缩容，而不是 30 个！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7d8df75976d7d71c",
      "translationZh": "更换基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b576155f6be06562",
      "translationZh": "在 AI 飞速发展的现实世界中，会发生什么？如果你想选择一个不同或更新的模型作为基础模型，该怎么办？虽然我们的示例使用 mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.1 作为基础模型，但也有其他基础模型，例如支持函数调用的 Mistral 的 v0.3，以及 Llama 3 这样完全不同的模型家族。总体而言，我们预计，效率更高、性能更好的新基础模型会不断推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1c5d435d4d281ea",
      "translationZh": "不过，不用担心！如果你有充分的理由更新基础模型，重新训练这些 LoRA 也很容易。训练成本相对较低；事实上，Predibase 发现，训练每个 LoRA 只需约 $8.00。借助现代框架和常见的工程实践，所需的代码改动很少：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64457debe45564cf",
      "translationZh": "保留用于训练模型的 notebook/代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41c9a652c624d23d",
      "translationZh": "对数据集进行版本控制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bcc474ee760f9e0",
      "translationZh": "记录所使用的配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d8a5c40dcba84ef",
      "translationZh": "使用新的模型/设置进行更新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8f797d7e4f6c0ed",
      "translationZh": "Multi-LoRA 服务为 AI 模型部署带来了一种变革性方法，为管理多个专用模型所面临的成本和复杂性障碍提供了解决方案。通过利用单个基础模型并动态应用微调后的适配器，组织可以显著降低运营开销，同时保持甚至提升在各种任务上的性能。各位 AI 总监，我们呼吁你们大胆行动，选择一个基础模型，拥抱 Multi-LoRA 范式；它带来的简便性和成本节约将产生丰厚回报。让 Multi-LoRA 成为你们 AI 战略的基石，确保你们的组织在快速演进的技术格局中保持领先。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0414a8743e419d3c",
      "translationZh": "实现 Multi-LoRA 服务可能相当棘手，但得益于 punica-ai 和 lorax 团队的出色工作，经过优化的内核和框架已被开发出来，使这一过程更加高效。TGI 利用这些优化，为多个 LoRA 模型提供快速、高效的推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b7a655383e92f48",
      "translationZh": "特别感谢 Punica、LoRAX 和 S-LoRA 团队在 multi-LoRA 服务方面所做的出色且开放的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69824d3b0e70ca6a",
      "translationZh": "参考文献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
